---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import InfoPage from '@/components/InfoPage.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Date Night Ideas" description="Privacy information for Date Night Ideas, including analytics, cookies, sharing, and advertising readiness." canonicalPath="/privacy">
  <InfoPage eyebrow="Privacy" title="Your date choices stay lightweight." intro="You do not need an account to use the Picker. This page describes the limited data the site may process.">
    <h2>Picker answers</h2><p>Your choices are processed in your browser and may appear in the shareable result URL. Do not add sensitive information to a URL you plan to share.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2><p>When analytics are enabled, we may collect aggregate events such as Picker starts, completions, refreshes, and Idea views. We do not ask for names, relationship profiles, or private messages.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2><p>Advertising is disabled at launch. If advertising or non-essential cookies are enabled later, the site will add the required consent controls and update this policy before those requests begin.</p>
    <h2>External links</h2><p>Source and activity links may lead to other websites. Their privacy practices apply once you leave this site.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>Privacy questions can be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@date-night-ideas.com">hello@date-night-ideas.com</a>.</p>
  </InfoPage>
</BaseLayout>
